It includes asynchronous processing, WebSocket support, efficient resource management, robust error handling, and fallback strategies for network failures, service outages, and function execution errors. The architecture supports horizontal scaling and graceful degradation, with minimal impact on ongoing operations during updates or configuration changes.

The code uses log and reqwest libraries to facilitate modular development, enabling easy addition of new functions and configuration updates without downtime. Comprehensive logging and monitoring capabilities are provided using the log library for debugging and performance tuning purposes.']

