[' Here's a high-level structure for the `DynamicFileProcessor` service in C#, using .NET Core. This solution will utilize various libraries to meet the requirements and constraints outlined:

```csharp
using System;
using System.Collections.Generic;
using System.IO;
using System.Linq;
using System.Net.Http;
