- Access controls and encryption: In the `AccessControlService`, enforce strict access controls, encryption for data at rest and in transit, secure authentication and authorization mechanisms, etc.

```java
public StorageObject decryptAndAuthenticateObject(UUID objectId) throws Exception {
    // Retrieve encrypted storage object from cloud storage provider
    StorageObject encryptedStorageObject = cloudStorageService.getEncryptedObject(objectId);

    // Decrypt and authenticate the storage object before returning it to the client
    StorageObject storageObject = decrypt(encryptedStorageObject);
    verifyAccessControl(storageObject);

