2. **Java function to process a linked list of file paths**

```java
public class FileUtil {
    private static final Lock lock = new ReentrantLock();

    public static void replaceFileNames(LinkedList<String> filePaths, String oldFileName, String newFileName) {
        lock.lock();
        try {
            for (Iterator<String> iterator = filePaths.iterator(); iterator.hasNext(); ) {
                String filePath = iterator.next();
                if (filePath.contains(oldFileName)) {
                    iterator.set(filePath.replaceAll(oldFileName, newFileName));
                }
            }
        } finally {
            lock.unlock();
        }
    }
}
```

